## [Visual Studio]
# Compilation and assembly results (executable files, dlls, intermediate code heaps)
.vs/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Log]/
logs/

# Visual Studio user settings files (window layout, open tabs)
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Diagnostic and profiling files
*.pe
*.psess
*.vsp
*.vspx
*.sap

## [Packages and Dependencies]
# Local NuGet package caches and the old-format packages folder
packages/
!packages/repositories.config
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## [Infrastructure and Local Configs]
# If local environment variable files appear in the future
.env
.env.local

## [WinForms Specific]
# Designer resource and layout cache files (regenerated by the studio upon opening)
_ReSharper*/
*ToolboxItem*.cache
*.Designer.cs.user

## [Testing]
# Test coverage reports and test runner logs
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage

## [Docker]
# Local database data, if you bind the volume to a local folder instead of a named volume
.docker/
